pageName = "Rarities"
pageDescription = "Rarities determine how often a card appears in the shop. Green bordered cards are Common, blue bordered cards are Rare, red bordered cards are Mythic, and yellow bordered cards are Legendary.

Mythic cards only start to appear from Ante 2. 

Legendary cards only start to appear from Ante 3 and have a much lower chance of appearing in the shop."
